      "description": "图标变体：36×36px 正方形、水平内边距 0。图标 20×20，currentColor 上色，必须带 aria-label。",
      "html": "<button class='ds-ai' type='button' aria-label='AI 模式'><span class='ds-ai-surface'></span><span class='ds-ai-label'><svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M17.5 12c0-3.04 2.46-5.5 5.5-5.5-3.04 0-5.5-2.46-5.5-5.5 0 3.04-2.46 5.5-5.5 5.5 3.04 0 5.5 2.46 5.5 5.5z'/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-ai{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:100px;font-family:var(--font-sans,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-ai::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:inherit;background:conic-gradient(#3186ff 34%,#9378ff 37%,#f96bd6 39%,#fc413d 41%,#fc413d 48%,#ff6b2b 50%,#fec700 52%,#ffdb0f 56%,#88de42 58%,#0ebc5f 61%,#0ebc5f 65%,#2eaab2 70%,#00a9bb 72%,#3186ff 73%,#3186ff 83%,#3186ff 100%);filter:blur(4px);opacity:0;rotate:0deg;transition:opacity .35s ease,rotate .6s cubic-bezier(0,0,0,1);z-index:0;pointer-events:none}.ds-ai:hover::before,.ds-ai:focus-visible::before{opacity:.6;rotate:225deg}.ds-ai-surface{position:absolute;inset:1px;border-radius:100px;background:#f0f4f9;transition:filter .15s;z-index:1}.ds-ai:hover .ds-ai-surface{filter:blur(2px)}.ds-ai:focus-visible{outline:none}.ds-ai:focus-visible .ds-ai-surface{outline:2px solid #1a73e8;outline-offset:2px}.ds-ai-label{position:relative;z-index:2;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#1f1f1f}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Aurora Button — Large Rounded",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-aurora-lg",
      "description": "组合示例：size=lg（48px / 内边距 16px）+ radius=rounded（8px）+ variant=highlighted，图标与文字间距 6px。圆角改变时光晕裁剪自动跟随（The Inherited Corner Rule）。",
      "html": "<button class='ds-al' type='button'><span class='ds-al-surface'></span><span class='ds-al-label'><svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M17.5 12c0-3.04 2.46-5.5 5.5-5.5-3.04 0-5.5-2.46-5.5-5.5 0 3.04-2.46 5.5-5.5 5.5 3.04 0 5.5 2.46 5.5 5.5z'/></svg>AI 模式</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-al{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:48px;padding:0 16px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1;font-weight:400;cursor:pointer}.ds-al::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:inherit;background:conic-gradient(#3186ff 34%,#9378ff 37%,#f96bd6 39%,#fc413d 41%,#fc413d 48%,#ff6b2b 50%,#fec700 52%,#ffdb0f 56%,#88de42 58%,#0ebc5f 61%,#0ebc5f 65%,#2eaab2 70%,#00a9bb 72%,#3186ff 73%,#3186ff 83%,#3186ff 100%);filter:blur(4px);opacity:0;rotate:0deg;transition:opacity .35s ease,rotate .6s cubic-bezier(0,0,0,1);z-index:0;pointer-events:none}.ds-al:hover::before,.ds-al:focus-visible::before{opacity:.6;rotate:225deg}.ds-al-surface{position:absolute;inset:1px;border-radius:8px;background:#d3e3fd;transition:filter .15s;z-index:1}.ds-al:hover .ds-al-surface{filter:blur(2px)}.ds-al:focus-visible{outline:none}.ds-al:focus-visible .ds-al-surface{outline:2px solid #1a73e8;outline-offset:2px}.ds-al-label{position:relative;z-index:2;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;color:#0b57d0}"
